\section{Architecture}
Bio-Agent OS consists of five layers, mirroring the human memory consolidation pipeline: L1 Working Memory, Hippocampus, L2 Semantic Memory, Persona, and Knowledge Graph.

\section{Evaluation}
We evaluated the system on an 8-pair benchmark. The hybrid detector achieved 100\% accuracy.

\section{Conclusion}
Bio-Agent OS demonstrates that biologically-inspired memory dynamics produce practical improvements in agent memory systems.

